[
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_261",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_inequalities"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Find the range of values of $x$ that satisfy $(x - 2)(x + 3) < 0$.",
    "question_zh": "求滿足 $(x - 2)(x + 3) < 0$ 的 $x$ 值範圍。",
    "options": [
      "A. $x < -3$ or $x > 2$",
      "B. $-3 < x < 2$",
      "C. $x < -2$ or $x > 3$",
      "D. $-2 < x < 3$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "The roots of the corresponding equation $(x-2)(x+3) = 0$ are $x = 2$ and $x = -3$.",
      "Since the leading coefficient of $x^2 + x - 6$ is positive, the parabola opens upwards.",
      "The value is negative ($< 0$) between the roots.",
      "So, $-3 < x < 2$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "對應方程 $(x-2)(x+3) = 0$ 的根為 $x = 2$ 及 $x = -3$。",
      "由於 $x^2 + x - 6$ 的首項係數為正數，拋物線開口向上。",
      "在兩根之間，函數值為負 ($< 0$)。",
      "故 $-3 < x < 2$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["inequalities", "quadratic-inequalities"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_262",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_circles"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "In a circle, $A, B, C, D$ are points on the circumference. If $\\angle CAD = 40^\\circ$, find $\\angle CBD$.",
    "question_zh": "在一圓中，$A, B, C, D$ 為圓周上的點。若 $\\angle CAD = 40^\\circ$，求 $\\angle CBD$。",
    "options": [
      "A. 20°",
      "B. 40°",
      "C. 50°",
      "D. 80°"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "By the property 'angles in the same segment', the angles subtended by the same arc at the circumference are equal.",
      "Both $\\angle CAD$ and $\\angle CBD$ are subtended by arc $CD$.",
      "Therefore, $\\angle CBD = \\angle CAD = 40^\\circ$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "根據「同弓形內的圓周角」性質，由同一弧所對的圓周角相等。",
      "$\\angle CAD$ 及 $\\angle CBD$ 均由弧 $CD$ 所對。",
      "因此，$\\angle CBD = \\angle CAD = 40^\\circ$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["circle-geometry", "geometry-theorems"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_263",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_trig_applications"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "In $\\triangle ABC$, $AB = 6$ cm, $AC = 4$ cm and $\\angle A = 30^\\circ$. Find the area of the triangle.",
    "question_zh": "在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$AB = 6$ cm，$AC = 4$ cm 且 $\\angle A = 30^\\circ$。求該三角形的面積。",
    "options": [
      "A. 6 cm$^2$",
      "B. 12 cm$^2$",
      "C. 24 cm$^2$",
      "D. $6\\sqrt{3}$ cm$^2$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Area $= \\frac{1}{2} bc \\sin A$.",
      "Area $= \\frac{1}{2} (4)(6) \\sin 30^\\circ = 12 \\times 0.5 = 6$ cm$^2$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "面積 $= \\frac{1}{2} bc \\sin A$。",
      "面積 $= \\frac{1}{2} (4)(6) \\sin 30^\\circ = 12 \\times 0.5 = 6$ cm$^2$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["trigonometry", "area-of-triangle"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_264",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_prob"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "In a mathematics test, the mean score is 70 and the standard deviation is 5. If John's score is 80, find his standard score.",
    "question_zh": "在一次數學測驗中，平均分為 70，標準差為 5。若小明的得分為 80，求他的標準分。",
    "options": [
      "A. 1",
      "B. 2",
      "C. 5",
      "D. 10"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Standard Score $z = \\frac{x - \\mu}{\\sigma}$.",
      "$z = \\frac{80 - 70}{5} = \\frac{10}{5} = 2$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "標準分 $z = \\frac{x - \\mu}{\\sigma}$。",
      "$z = \\frac{80 - 70}{5} = \\frac{10}{5} = 2$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["dispersion", "standard-score"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_265",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_inequalities"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "Find the maximum value of $f = x + 2y$ subject to $x \\ge 2$, $y \\ge 1$ and $x + y \\le 6$.",
    "question_zh": "在 $x \\ge 2$，$y \\ge 1$ 及 $x + y \\le 6$ 的條件下，求 $f = x + 2y$ 的最大值。",
    "options": [
      "A. 6",
      "B. 8",
      "C. 10",
      "D. 11"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Feasible region vertices: Intersection of $(x=2, y=1) \\to (2,1)$, $(y=1, x+y=6) \\to (5,1)$, $(x=2, x+y=6) \\to (2,4)$.",
      "At $(2, 1): f = 2 + 2(1) = 4$.",
      "At $(5, 1): f = 5 + 2(1) = 7$.",
      "At $(2, 4): f = 2 + 2(4) = 10$.",
      "Maximum value is 10."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "可行解區域頂點：$(x=2, y=1) \\to (2,1)$、$(y=1, x+y=6) \\to (5,1)$、$(x=2, x+y=6) \\to (2,4)$。",
      "在 $(2, 1)$：$f = 2 + 2(1) = 4$。",
      "在 $(5, 1)$：$f = 5 + 2(1) = 7$。",
      "在 $(2, 4)$：$f = 2 + 2(4) = 10$。",
      "最大值為 10。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["linear-programming", "optimization"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_266",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_num_percentages"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "The price of a computer first increases by 20% and then decreases by 10%. What is the net percentage change in the price?",
    "question_zh": "一部電腦的價格先增加 20%，然後減少 10%。價格的淨百分比變化是多少？",
    "options": [
      "A. Increase 10%",
      "B. Increase 8%",
      "C. Increase 12%",
      "D. Decrease 2%"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let initial price be $P$.",
      "Price after increase: $P \\times (1 + 0.2) = 1.2P$.",
      "Price after decrease: $1.2P \\times (1 - 0.1) = 1.2P \\times 0.9 = 1.08P$.",
      "Net change: $(1.08 - 1) \\times 100\\% = 8\\%$ increase."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設初始價格為 $P$。",
      "增加後的價格：$P \\times 1.2 = 1.2P$。",
      "減少後的價格：$1.2P \\times 0.9 = 1.08P$。",
      "淨變化：$(1.08 - 1) \\times 100\\% = 8\\%$ 增加。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["percentages", "number-systems"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_267",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_coord"],
    "marks": 11,
    "difficulty": 8,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "A triangle $ABC$ has vertices $A(0, 0)$, $B(6, 0)$ and $C(3, 9)$.\n(a) Find the coordinates of the centroid $G$ of constant $\\triangle ABC$. (4 marks)\n(b) Find the equation of the median from $C$ to $AB$. (4 marks)\n(c) Show that $G$ lies on the median from $C$. (3 marks)",
    "question_zh": "三角形 $ABC$ 的頂點為 $A(0, 0)$, $B(6, 0)$ 及 $C(3, 9)$。\n(a) 求 $\\triangle ABC$ 的形心 $G$ 的坐標。(4分)\n(b) 求從點 $C$ 到 $AB$ 的中線方程。(4分)\n(c) 證明 $G$ 位於從 $C$ 出發的中線上。(3分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Centroid $G = (\\frac{0+6+3}{3}, \\frac{0+0+9}{3}) = (3, 3)$.",
      "(b) Midpoint of $AB$, $M = (\\frac{0+6}{2}, \\frac{0+0}{2}) = (3, 0)$.",
      " Equation of median $CM$: The x-coordinates of $C(3, 9)$ and $M(3, 0)$ are both 3.",
      " So the equation is $x = 3$.",
      "(c) Since the $x$-coordinate of $G(3, 3)$ is 3, it satisfies $x = 3$.",
      " Thus $G$ lies on the median $CM$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 形心 $G = (\\frac{0+6+3}{3}, \\frac{0+0+9}{3}) = (3, 3)$。",
      "(b) $AB$ 的中點 $M = (\\frac{0+6}{2}, \\frac{0+0}{2}) = (3, 0)$。",
      "中線 $CM$ 的方程：$C(3, 9)$ 與 $M(3, 0)$ 的 $x$-坐標均為 3。",
      "故方程為 $x = 3$。",
      "(c) 由於 $G(3, 3)$ 的 $x$-坐標為 3，它滿足 $x = 3$。",
      "因此 $G$ 位於中線 $CM$ 上。"
    ],
