  {
    "id": "ct_sa_268",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_apgp"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "The general term of an arithmetic sequence is $T_n = 5n + 2$.\n(a) Find the first term and the common difference. (4 marks)\n(b) Find the sum of the first 50 terms. (4 marks)\n(c) Find the least value of $k$ such that the sum of the first $k$ terms exceeds 2000. (4 marks)",
    "question_zh": "等差數列的通項為 $T_n = 5n + 2$。\n(a) 求首項及公差。(4分)\n(b) 求首 50 項之和。(4分)\n(c) 求 $k$ 的最小值使得首 $k$ 項之和超過 2000。(4分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) $T_1 = 5(1) + 2 = 7$. $T_2 = 5(2) + 2 = 12$. Difference $d = 12 - 7 = 5$.",
      "(b) $S_{50} = \\frac{50}{2} [2(7) + (50-1)(5)] = 25 [14 + 245] = 25 [259] = 6475$.",
      "(c) $S_k = \\frac{k}{2} [14 + (k-1)5] = \\frac{k}{2} [5k + 9] > 2000$.",
      "$5k^2 + 9k - 4000 > 0$.",
      "Roots of $5k^2 + 9k - 4000 = 0$ are $k \\approx 27.38$.",
      "Least integer $k = 28$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) $T_1 = 7, T_2 = 12$。公差 $d = 5$。",
      "(b) $S_{50} = 25 [14 + 245] = 6475$。",
      "(c) $S_k = \\frac{k}{2} [5k + 9] > 2000 \\Rightarrow 5k^2 + 9k - 4000 > 0$。",
      "方程的根約為 $27.38$。最小整數 $k = 28$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["arithmetic-sequence", "summation"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_269",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_mensuration"],
    "marks": 13,
    "difficulty": 8,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "A frustum is formed by cutting a right circular cone of height 12 cm and base radius 5 cm with a plane parallel to the base at a height of 6 cm from the base.\n(a) Find the radius of the top circular surface of the frustum. (4 marks)\n(b) Find the volume of the original cone. (3 marks)\n(c) Find the volume of the frustum in terms of $\\pi$. (6 marks)",
    "question_zh": "一個下底半徑為 5 cm、高為 12 cm 的正圓錐體，在距離底部 6 cm 處被一個平行於底面的平面截斷，形成一個圓台。\n(a) 求圓台頂部圓面的半徑。(4分)\n(b) 求原圓錐體的體積。(3分)\n(c) 以 $\\pi$ 表示圓台的體積。(6分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Using similar triangles: $\\frac{r}{5} = \\frac{12 - 6}{12} = \\frac{1}{2}$.",
      " So top radius $r = 2.5$ cm.",
      "(b) Vol of large cone $= \\frac{1}{3} \\pi (5^2)(12) = 100\\pi$ cm$^3$.",
      "(c) Vol of small cone removed $= \\frac{1}{3} \\pi (2.5^2)(6) = \\frac{1}{3} \\pi (6.25)(6) = 12.5\\pi$ cm$^3$.",
      " Vol of frustum $= 100\\pi - 12.5\\pi = 87.5\\pi$ cm$^3$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 利用相似三角形：$\\frac{r}{5} = \\frac{6}{12} = \\frac{1}{2}$。",
      "頂部半徑 $r = 2.5$ cm。",
      "(b) 大圓錐體積 $= \\frac{1}{3} \\pi (5^2)(12) = 100\\pi$ cm$^3$。",
      "(c) 被截去的小圓錐體積 $= \\frac{1}{3} \\pi (2.5^2)(6) = 12.5\\pi$ cm$^3$。",
      "圓台體積 $= 100\\pi - 12.5\\pi = 87.5\\pi$ cm$^3$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": {
