  {
    "id": "ct_sa_270",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_prob"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 8,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "A committee of 3 is to be chosen from a group of 5 boys and 4 girls.\n(a) How many different committees can be formed? (3 marks)\n(b) If the committee must contain at least one girl, find the number of possible committees. (4 marks)\n(c) If two specific boys refused to be in the same committee together, how many ways can the committee be formed? (5 marks)",
    "question_zh": "從 5 名男孩及 4 名女孩中挑選 3 人組成一個委員會。\n(a) 共有多少種不同的組成方法？(3分)\n(b) 若委員會中必須至少包含一名女孩，求組成方法的數目。(4分)\n(c) 若兩位指定的男孩拒絕在同一個委員會中出現，求組成方法的數目。(5分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Total combinations $C^9_3 = \\frac{9 \\times 8 \\times 7}{3 \\times 2 \\times 1} = 84$.",
      "(b) Total - (No girls). No girls means all boys: $C^5_3 = 10$.",
      " Ways $= 84 - 10 = 74$.",
      "(c) Total - (Both specific boys are inside).",
      " If both specific boys are in, we need 1 more person from the remaining 7.",
      " Ways with both boys $= C^7_1 = 7$.",
      " Required ways $= 84 - 7 = 77$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 總組合數 $C^9_3 = 84$。",
      "(b) 總數 - (全男孩)。全男孩為 $C^5_3 = 10$。",
      "方法數 $= 84 - 10 = 74$。",
      "(c) 總數 - (兩位指定男孩同時加入)。",
      "若兩位均加入，則剩下的 7 人中選 1 人：$C^7_1 = 7$。",
      "要求的方法數 $= 84 - 7 = 77$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["combinations", "counting-principles"],
    "status": "approved"
  }
]
